  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Before a large battle, Fang Yuan, Hei Lou Lan, and Hao Ji Liu arrange for a water-image decoy to stand as “Chang Shan Yin.” When that decoy is cut down, it becomes a puddle of water and leaves a Water Image Gu almost pierced in two.",
        "chapters": [
          512
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "imperial-court-battles",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "char_chang_shan_yin"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later notes that without that Water Image Gu arrangement he would already have been dead after Hei Xiu Yi deserted him.",
        "chapters": [
          515
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "imperial-court-battles",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_xiu_yi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hao Ji Liu again hides his real body and leaves a water image when Pei Yan Fei’s Golden Rainbow Strike bursts through a waterfall; Pei Yan Fei cuts the image, not the real body.",
        "chapters": [
          525
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "imperial-court-battles",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_pei_yan_fei",
          "move_golden_rainbow_strike"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later commentary also names Water Image Gu among Hao Ji Liu’s first-rate escaping methods, while calling him a water path Gu Master.",
        "chapters": [
          584
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "imperial-court-battles",
